OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 3 JUN
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Arthur Bliss
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod with guest
OL,6,     Gbiographer Paul Spicer explore
OL,7,     Gthe early years of marriage for
OL,8,     GBliss, including his
OL,9,     Gcollaborations with the BBC.
OL,10,G1700FIn Tune
OL,11,     GKatie Derham with live music in
OL,12,     Gthe studio from Owain Park and
OL,13,     GThe Gesualdo Six, and violinist
OL,14,     GAlina Ibragimova talks about her
OL,15,     Gnew album.
OL,16,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,17,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,18,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,19,     Gfavourites.
