OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 3 JUN
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GAs part of Wigmore Hall's 125th
OL,6,     GAnniversary Festival, the Belcea
OL,7,     GQuartet are joined by viola
OL,8,     Gplayer Tabea Zimmermann in string
OL,9,     Gquintets by Mozart and Brahms.
OL,10,G2145FThe Essay: The Other
OL,11,     FShostakoviches
OL,12,     GChris Addison tries to make sense
OL,13,     Gof the brutal, strange music of
OL,14,     GGalina Ustvolskaya - music that
OL,15,     Gexplores the very extremes of
OL,16,     Gmusic-making yet has a powerfully
OL,17,     Gspiritual quality.
